[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_1]
Heating fee increase

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_1_desc]
Recently, the government of Las Pegasus City proposed a new plan to significantly increase the heating fees for residential and industrial use.
This proposal has been strongly opposed by the citizens, who took to the streets to protest against the government’s proposal, saying that this move will bring a heavy burden to their lives.
Las Pegasus Group, which is most affected, also issued a statement today, expressing pity over the government’s proposal and expressing hope that the proposal will not be implemented in the end, but also said that it will respect the government’s final decision.

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_1_o0]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_2]
Las Pegasus City Government Declares Bankruptcy!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_2_desc]
Due to the shortage of heating fuel in Las Pegasus, the city government had to import heating fuel from other places at a high price to ensure the heating of residents. The proposal to raise the heating fees for civil and industrial use was rejected, and the Equestria Empire Ministry of Finance refused to pay for the budget growth of Las Pegasus city. This eventually led to the financial crisis of the city government, and today, the city government declared bankruptcy.
Fortunately, the Las Pegasus Group, headquartered in Las Pegasus, is a socially responsible enterprise. The Las Pegasus Group announced that from today, Las Pegasus Municipal Co., Ltd. under the Las Pegasus Group will take over all the functions of the city government to ensure the basic living rights of the citizens; at the same time, Las Pegasus Heating Co., Ltd. under the Las Pegasus Group will provide heating services to the citizens at a slightly higher price than the original heating fee, but lower than the price the government proposed. Las Pegasus Group will bear all the debts of the city government, and after that, Las Pegasus will no longer be responsible to the Equestria Empire, but will become the first city owned by a private enterprise in Equestria.
Most of the Las Pegasus residents expressed their support, believing that this is a major progress of the city government and a new beginning of Las Pegasus. However, some residents believe that the Las Pegasus Energy Group monopolizes the heating services and exports to other places, which is the root cause of the shortage of heating fuel in Las Pegasus, and Las Pegasus Group should be responsible for the bankruptcy of the city government.

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_2_o0]
Mission accomplished!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_2_o1]
Okay

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_3]
Las Pegasus Energy Group Announces New Energy Project

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_3_desc]
Introducing “EnergiX”: A Quantum Leap in New Energy Revolution!
In the realm of cutting-edge technology, a paradigm-shifting breakthrough has emerged that promises to redefine the very fabric of our energy landscape. Behold, the revolutionary energy solution: EnergiX, an awe-inspiring fusion of quantum mechanics and state-of-the-art engineering, poised to propel our civilization into a future powered by sustainable, clean energy sources.
EnergiX transcends the limitations of conventional power generation methods, ushering in a new era of unparalleled efficiency, reliability, and environmental consciousness. Through an intricate web of advanced algorithms, nanoscale materials, and astrophysics-inspired principles, this groundbreaking innovation harnesses the immense power locked within the Equestria’s geological reservoirs.
Specifically, the EnergiX project plans to build a series of cutting-edge drilling apparatuses navigate the labyrinthine pathways beneath the Equestria’s earth surface with unparalleled precision. With each percussive pulse, PetroSpectra’s quantum-tuned drills extract the precious hydrocarbon abundance that lies dormant, deep within the Equestria’s geological embrace.
So, behold the dawn of a new energy era, where the boundaries of possibility are shattered, and the promise of a sustainable future becomes an attainable reality. EnergiX stands at the vanguard of this revolution, a beacon of hope guiding us towards a harmonious coexistence with Equestria and a brighter tomorrow for generations to come.
Embrace the power of EnergiX, and prepare to witness the true potential of new energy unleashed!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_3_o0]
It’s just oil

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_3_o1]
Isn’t that... oil?

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_4]
Las Pegasus-Appleloosa Reciprocity Agreement

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_4_desc]
Las Pegasus has invited us to engage in economic cooperation. They will provide us with technological support, and we will provide them with agricultural resources. The cooperation will start with a reciprocity agreement, and we hope to join the Western Equestria Trade Alliance in the future. However, joining the trade alliance requires the consent of our ally, Rock Farm. Therefore, we will only discuss the reciprocity agreement with Las Pegasus for now.
It is worth noting that the two brothers of the Las Pegasus Consortium have a bad reputation and are known for their rich experience in breaking promises. We need to be careful not to be deceived by their sweet words.

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_4_o0]
Agree to cooperate

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_4_o1]
Refuse the proposal

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_5]
Appleloosa Signs the Reciprocity Agreement

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_5_desc]
Appleloosa has accepted our proposal for a reciprocity agreement!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_5_o0]
Good!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_6]
Appleloosa Refuses the Reciprocity Agreement

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_6_desc]
Appleloosa has refused our proposal for a reciprocity agreement!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_6_o0]
Alas...

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_7]
Las Pegasus-Rock Farm Reciprocity Agreement

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_7_desc]
Las Pegasus has invited us to engage in economic cooperation. They will provide us with technological support, and we will provide them with manufacturing resources. The cooperation will start with a reciprocity agreement, and we hope to join the Western Equestria Trade Alliance in the future. However, joining the trade alliance requires the consent of our ally, Appleloosa. Therefore, we will only discuss the reciprocity agreement with Las Pegasus for now.
It is worth noting that the two brothers of the Las Pegasus Consortium have a bad reputation and are known for their rich experience in breaking promises. We need to be careful not to be deceived by their sweet words.

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_7_o0]
Agree to cooperate

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_7_o1]
Refuse the proposal

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_8]
Rock Farm Signs the Reciprocity Agreement

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_8_desc]
Rock Farm has accepted our proposal for a reciprocity agreement!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_8_o0]
Good!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_9]
Rock Farm Refuses the Reciprocity Agreement

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_9_desc]
Rock Farm has refused our proposal for a reciprocity agreement!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_9_o0]
Alas...

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_10]
WETA Invitation

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_10_desc]
Las Pegasus has invited us to join the WETA (Western Equestrian Trade Alliance).

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_10_o0]
Agree to cooperate

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_10_o1]
Refuse the proposal

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_11]
Sire’s Hollow Joins WETA

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_11_desc]
Sire’s Hollow has accepted our proposal and joined the trade alliance!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_11_o0]
Good!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_12]
Sire’s Hollow Refuses WETA

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_12_desc]
Sire’s Hollow has refused the invitation to join the trade alliance.

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_12_o0]
Alas...

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_13]
Leota Real Estate Investment

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_13_desc]
Our investment in [FROM.FROM.GetName] has been a huge success: we have built skyscrapers in the jungle wasteland and turned them into rubber plantations, resorts, jungle huts, and jungle adventure souvenir shops. Our investment has begun to pay off, and all shareholders are very satisfied — except for the creatures of Leota. Fortunately, they can’t vote against us at the shareholders’ meeting, so what does it matter?

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_13_o0]
Good!

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_14]
Negotiate with the empire

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_14_desc]
The Empire has been plunged into war — now is the best time for us to step forward and negotiate. We can use our army and our technology to extract far greater, safer gains from the Empress. After all, a victorious Empire better fits our plans for the future. We don’t actually need to send troops to attack; we only have to make everypony think we will.

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_14_o0]
Good!Send an envoy. Let’s see what terms the Empire will offer

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_14_o1]
should we simply stand by and watch the Empire and the rebels burn together?

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_15]
Las Pegasus requests an audience

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_15_desc]
“Your Majesty, allow me to pay homage on behalf of Las Pegasus,” the envoy said.

Cozy Glow lifted her gaze from the sand table to the little pony before her, who was fidgeting and forcing a smile. “You’d better be direct while I’m still not in the mood to make trouble for Las Pegasus,” she snapped. “I’m not interested in bargaining. If you talk to me with the same oily tongue as Flim Flam, I’ll personally pull your tongue out and stuff it back into those phony, insincere eye-sockets of yours,” Cozy Glow finished, her tone all acid.

“I fully trust that Your Majesty has the ability,” the Las Pegasus envoy continued. “Although the two brothers were tied up with affairs and couldn’t come personally, they care deeply about the Empire’s situation and very much hope the Empire will achieve final victory in the war…”

“Those two bastards! If they really cared about me, I would have ordered their allied forces sent to support the Imperial Army as soon as the rebels rose!” Cozy Glow exploded.

“Please forgive us, Your Majesty,” the envoy said calmly. “Las Pegasus needs a safe and stable political environment to provide the Empire with the strongest technological support. That is far more important than sending troops directly like other governorates. I trust Your Majesty understands this.”

Cozy Glow’s temper eased a notch — this was not the moment to pick a fight with Las Pegasus. “So, what now?” she asked.

“Thanks to the Empire’s substantial assistance and a more stable research environment, no nation has been able to detect what we’ve been working on. Now, breakthroughs in cutting-edge magic and physics theory have been made. We are confident we can develop truly devastating weapons in the near future. If I may speak plainly: even though the Empire has the strongest military in all Equestria and should be able to sweep the rebels aside, the strategic situation is not optimistic. Aside from the eastern forces led by Starlight Glimmer, the Empire’s troops are facing attacks from multiple directions. Several neutral nations are also planning to grab a share while the Empire is distracted.”

“You say all this… I — of course I know it,” Cozy Glow replied quickly, not wanting this pony to think she didn’t understand the grand strategy. “I am the cleverest pony in all Equestria, after all.”

“Then I believe Your Majesty can understand Las Pegasus’s earlier prudence. Las Pegasus also understands this is the best time to help ease Your burden. If Las Pegasus enters the war now, we can not only relieve pressure on the Imperial front, but also provide a real combat testing ground for the ultimate weapon we are about to complete… However, if Your Majesty will consent, we will need increased R&D funding and additional economic support….”

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_15_o0]
“You want whatever you want — fine, just get moving. Don’t waste my time!”

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_15_o1]
“Damn those two brothers, coming to me for money again, Let them think hard about who’s actually in charge.”

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_16]
Successful negotiation

[en.EVENT_C07_MAIN_16_desc]
